		{"id":"output","type":"text","text":"## Disparity result → SDRAM · planned\n\n(d*, SAD*, x, y, valid) to output FIFO. If P_LANES<32, merge best across passes before writeback.","x":875,"y":2155,"width":610,"height":200,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"left-delay","type":"text","text":"## Left column delay · planned\n\nOne K-pixel column register (11 pixels by default); delay L[x] one clock to match the right cache.","x":180,"y":520,"width":600,"height":220,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"fanout","type":"text","text":"## Left-column fan-out · planned\n\nBroadcast delayed L[x] to all 32 engines. Carry valid and (x,y); right taps bypass this block.","x":220,"y":880,"width":520,"height":180,"color":"5"}
